    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Meta-analyse controlled crosses at graded genetic distances for offspring survival, growth, fertility and reproductive output. Higher performance after moderate outcrossing and lower performance after close inbreeding support the claim; flat or opposite average effects refute it.";
